        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her subjects came to the dwarf queen with alarming news. All neighboring countries have started a big war and the country of the gnomes is unlikely to be able to avoid it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Court advisers reported that the country was not ready for war and it was necessary to postpone entry into the conflict as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the queen invites all parties to board their ships and meet in neutral waters for negotiations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your loyal subjects are waiting for help! Embark on a new adventure with the heroine and her friends through amazing places: Abandoned Settlements, Dryad's Forest and much more! Mysteries, mystical creatures, mysterious events - all this in the exciting casual fantasy strategy Gnomes Garden:  Black Stones. A lot of different tasks, more than 40 levels, an intriguing plot, simple and exciting gameplay and an unusual universe are waiting for you right now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes Garden: Black Stones - Help the gnomes defeat evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An unusual magical world, the source of magic of which is ancient gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fun plot, colorful comics and bright characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Many different tasks that the queen has not yet encountered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 40 unique levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unusual enemies: evil gremlins, angry bears, and... chthonic monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 unique locations: Abandoned settlements, Dryad's Forest, Gloomy Thicket, Valley of Black Stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Useful bonuses: acceleration of time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple controls and clear training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 20 hours of addictive gameplay for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nice theme music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
